{"speciesId":453,"names":{"fr":"Cradopaud","es":"Croagunk","en":"Croagunk","ja":"グレッグル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its cheeks hold poison sacs. It tries to catch foes off guard to jab them with toxic fingers."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Inflating its poison sacs, it makes an eerie blubbering sound for intimidation."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It rarely fights fairly, but that is strictly to ensure survival. It is popular as a mascot."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Fluid squeezed from its finger, albeit poisonous, is a significant ingredient in remedies for lower-back pain."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Fluid squeezed from its finger, albeit poisonous, is a significant ingredient in remedies for lower back pain."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Son instinct de survie le pousse à ne pas se battre dans les règles. C’est une mascotte populaire."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It rarely fights fairly, but that is strictly to ensure survival. It is popular as a mascot."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Son instinct de survie le pousse à ne pas se battre dans les règles. C’est une mascotte populaire."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It rarely fights fairly, but that is strictly to ensure survival. It is popular as a mascot."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Inflating its poison sacs, it fills the area with an odd sound and hits flinching opponents with a poison jab."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Inflating its poison sacs, it fills the area with an odd sound and hits flinching opponents with a poison jab."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ses joues contiennent des glandes toxiques. Il attaque par surprise et utilise son toucher empoisonné."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Tiene bolsas venenosas en las mejillas. Pilla desprevenidos a sus rivales para pincharles."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its cheeks hold poison sacs. It tries to catch foes off guard to jab them with toxic fingers."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"ほっぺたに 毒袋を 持つ。 相手の すきを ついて 猛毒を にじませている 指を 突き刺す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ses glandes se gonflent de venin tout en émettant un son effrayant, le laissant ainsi empoisonner ses proies pétrifiées."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Infla sus bolsas venenosas para emitir un sonido macabro mientras asesta golpes que hacen retroceder a los rivales."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Inflating its poison sacs, it fills the area with an odd sound and hits flinching opponents with a poison jab."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"毒袋を ふくらませて 鳴らし 辺りに 不気味な 音を 響かせ 相手が ひるむと どくづきをする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ses joues contiennent des glandes toxiques. Il attaque par surprise et utilise son toucher empoisonné."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Tiene bolsas venenosas en las mejillas. Pilla desprevenidos a sus rivales para pincharles."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Its cheeks hold poison sacs. It tries to catch foes off guard to jab them with toxic fingers."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"ほっぺたに 毒袋を 持つ。 相手の すきを ついて 猛毒を にじませている 指を 突き刺す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ses glandes se gonflent de venin tout en émettant un son effrayant, le laissant ainsi empoisonner ses proies pétrifiées."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Infla sus bolsas venenosas para emitir un sonido macabro mientras asesta golpes que hacen retroceder a los rivales."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Inflating its poison sacs, it fills the area with an odd sound and hits flinching opponents with a poison jab."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"毒袋を ふくらませて 鳴らし 辺りに 不気味な 音を 響かせ 相手が ひるむと どくづきをする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il intimide ses ennemis en faisant résonner les glandes toxiques de ses joues, puis leur porte un coup empoisonné par surprise."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Amenaza a los rivales haciendo sonar las bolsas venenosas de sus mejillas y aprovecha su estupor para inyectarles toxinas."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It makes frightening noises with its poison-filled cheek sacs. When opponents flinch, Croagunk hits them with a poison jab."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"頬の 毒袋を 鳴らして 敵を 威嚇。 ひるんだ 隙に 毒突きを おみまいする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Dilué, son poison sert de remède. Cela lui a valu de devenir la mascotte populaire d’une entreprise de produits pharmaceutiques."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Su veneno posee propiedades medicinales si se diluye. Se ha vuelto muy popular desde que una empresa farmacéutica lo adoptó como mascota."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Once diluted, its poison becomes medicinal. This Pokémon came into popularity after a pharmaceutical company chose it as a mascot."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"毒を 薄めると 薬に なる。 薬品会社の マスコットに なって 人気者に なった。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"A poison wielder with a dastardly personality. Despite such qualities, this species is afforded a measure of popularity due to its peculiar cry and comical features."}],"varieties":[{"id":453,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[10,"tutor",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"take-down","lea